---
import "../../style.css";
import { proDesign } from "../../pro-design.js";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#08090b" />
  <meta name="description" content="Development status, earlier Mini references, and the Pro compact PC design price target. Sales and reservations are closed." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://avocadomini.si/preorder/" />
  <title>Price & development status — avokado</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" type="image/png" />
  <script is:inline src="/site-enhancements.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="subpage preorder-page">
  <header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" alt="" />avokado</a><nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Navigation"><a href="/mini/">Mini</a><a href="/pro/">Pro</a><a href="/install/">RockstarOS</a></nav></header>
  <main class="preorder-main">
    <section class="preorder-hero" aria-labelledby="preorder-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">AVOKADO / DEVELOPMENT STATUS</p><h1 id="preorder-title">Built in public.<br>Not yet for sale.</h1><p class="lead">Explore the designs while development continues. Mini figures are earlier product-line references. Pro has a design price target, not an offer or confirmed total.</p><div class="preorder-state" role="status">NOT YET FOR SALE / NO PAYMENT OR RESERVATION</div></div>
      <img src={proDesign.image} alt="Pro compact PC design study, not production hardware; candidate specifications and target price are unvalidated" />
    </section>
    <section class="status-plans" aria-labelledby="status-plans-title">
      <div class="status-plans-head"><p class="eyebrow">CHOOSE BY OUTCOME</p><h2 id="status-plans-title">Where do you want<br>to begin?</h2><p>Mini and Pro each target independent operation. Pairing remains optional and unvalidated.</p></div>
      <div class="status-plan-grid">
        <article><span>01 / SPATIAL INPUT</span><h3>One avocadoMini</h3><p>Turn movement into input for one local experience.</p><strong>From ¥160,000</strong><em>Approx. US$1,050</em><a href="/mini/">See what Mini gives you →</a></article>
        <article><span>02 / WIDER COVERAGE</span><h3>Four-Mini package</h3><p>Give a larger shared space more viewpoints and room to move.</p><strong>¥410,000</strong><em>Approx. US$2,700</em><a href="/mini/#product">See the 180° product story →</a></article>
        <article><span>03 / si + PC GAMES</span><h3>avokadoPro</h3><p>An independent NVIDIA compact PC design. Mini is optional; hardware is not yet assembled.</p><strong>{proDesign.targetLabel}</strong><em>Tax and shipping undecided</em><a href="/pro/">Read the Pro design →</a></article>
      </div>
      <p class="status-fineprint">Mini reference amounts exclude tax and shipping and do not establish R5 pricing. Pro’s ¥800,000 target has no confirmed tax, shipping, warranty, or final sale price. No package, delivery date, or payment terms are confirmed.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="price-history" aria-labelledby="price-history-title"><h2 id="price-history-title">Design targets and earlier references</h2><p>The earlier Pro product page used “From ¥880,000” with an approximate US$5,800 reference. That figure is not inherited by the 2026-10-05 compact-PC design. Its ¥800,000 sales target is not a replacement sales offer. Final price and terms require a separate decision after supplier quotes and validation.</p><p>The earlier Mini references of ¥160,000 for one and ¥410,000 for four do not settle the current R5 price or bundle. Four Minis and a separate Hub are not required by the R5 design.</p><a href={proDesign.source}>Source: Pro design and open conditions ↗</a> · <a href="/legal/">Sales disclosure →</a></section>
    <section class="support-cta" aria-labelledby="status-support-title"><p>HELP IT MOVE FORWARD</p><h2 id="status-support-title">Want to see this become real?</h2><span>Follow development, share the project, and tell others what kind of experience you want the room to unlock.</span><div><a href="https://www.instagram.com/kirin.41/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow the build ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/k999ln/rock" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the project ↗</a></div></section>
  </main>
  <style>.price-history { padding: 50px max(24px, 8vw); max-width: 1200px; margin: auto; line-height: 1.8; } .price-history h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; } .preorder-hero > img { object-fit: contain; background: #10151b; } .preorder-state { width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.6; }</style>
  <footer><span>© 2026 AVOKADO LLC</span><div><a href="/legal/">Sales terms</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/">Back to products ↗</a></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
